From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiny <owner@shinychang.net>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:49:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rename to Shiny with its own icon and bundle id, add
 smoke test

- BRANDING: product name Shiny, bundle id net.shinychang.Shiny; the profile
  directory stays "Chromium IDE" (CrProductDirName) so existing data is kept.
- chromium_strings.grd: product name, short name and window title formats.
- Mac icon: line-art S (AppIcon.icon), compiled to Assets.car and app.icns
  with Xcode 27.1 actool.
- views/ide/smoke.mjs: 22-check runtime smoke test; refuses to run on a
  non-IDE app, a locked screen, or a Mac with recent physical input.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BYkQJUafT3hpFT1kBmDgzX
